{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0011_1000_011ami", "source_sha256": "99f69cb2c8d517c0b732949519e608b70394199b94295306adbb702ed7acef1a", "ja": "はぁ……はぁ……はぁ……。\n兄ちゃん、どうしよう。問題だよ、大問題だよ！？", "zh": "呼……呼……呼……\n大哥哥，怎么办？出问题了，出大问题了啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0011_1001_p", "source_sha256": "cfb1250c0b33248e219021d553598bb48c0c9f350a8155c31f7e81c30fb6f6e9", "ja": "ど、どうしたんだ亜美。\n大問題って、なにがあったんだ？", "zh": "怎、怎么啦，亚美？\n你说出大问题，到底是怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0011_1002_011ami", "source_sha256": "4318e02c1d066064f05da5eb4b9aa43dd278cb9af689fc164604d722cd990ac5", "ja": "39の子たちの中に、鬼ごっこでゼンゼン\n捕まえられない子が、いっぱいいるの！", "zh": "跟39的伙伴们玩捉迷藏的时候，\n有好多人亚美完全抓不到！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0011_1003_011ami", "source_sha256": "da669ab46e205441374d1ef506ffe750c313f7d09c867262481ed6014bd8db5d", "ja": "すごい！　すごいよ兄ちゃん！　亜美、来る日も\n来る日もツラいトレーニングに耐えてきてよかった！", "zh": "好厉害！好厉害喔，大哥哥！\n还好亚美每天都不断忍耐着辛苦的训练！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0011_1004_p", "source_sha256": "cfd235490af27378bbea61b0e0330b6853f427529769a826cf9dc3f0c93743a9", "ja": "そうか……。目的がちょっと違う気がするが、\nよかったな、亜美。", "zh": "这样啊……虽然跟原本的目的好像不太一样，\n但真是太好了呢，亚美。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0011_1005_011ami", "source_sha256": "59f7d5c0f59ce17aa5012882e4463f8850b973c3ad0f5fa6bb72941a59d65068", "ja": "でも、見てて！　亜美は兄ちゃんの名にかけて、\n絶対に捕まえてみせるから！", "zh": "但是你看好！赌上大哥哥之名，\n亚美绝对会抓到她们给你看的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0011_1006_p", "source_sha256": "1502c26198c24729abc2092ea7122bfdaf0349ee925acd1a01127639323ef294", "ja": "ああ、期待してるぞ。鬼ごっこでもアイドルでも、\n新人に負けないように！", "zh": "嗯，我很期待你的表现。\n不管捉迷藏还是偶像活动，都别输给新人啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0011_1007_011ami", "source_sha256": "0b95bf08e7cd8a06330fb7b8fd67abe6514762072e0b1944f6113684292c6748", "ja": "うんっ、今から亜美は、亜美3.0ね♪\n兄ちゃん、チャンネルはそのままでー！", "zh": "嗯，从现在开始的亚美，是亚美3.0♪\n大哥哥可不能转台喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
